  "definition": "Aiding and Abetting an Understatement of Tax Liability",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-02-07",
  "historyNote": "#6336, eff 9-24-96; ss by #8178, eff 9-24-04; ss by #10213, eff 10-24-12; renumbered by #13002 (formerly Rev 1610.03); ss by #13553, eff 2-7-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 1600)",
